  # Incident Escalation Formatter

  Format complete incident summaries to minimize engineer triage time and prevent repeated user questioning.

  ## Procedure
  1. Summarize the initial issue reported by the employee in one concise line.
  2. List all verified diagnostic steps and outcomes attempted during the session.
  3. Extract specific machine details: Hostname/OS version, software version, exact error messages or codes.
  4. Classify Priority: P1 (Critical business blocker affecting multiple staff), P2 (Major function unavailable, work blocked), P3 (Degraded performance or workaround available), P4 (Informational or minor request).
  5. Present the summary to the user for confirmation before submitting to the engineering dispatch queue.
